session. Deliberately NOT gated to native-only (unlike
CapacitorPush.tsx) since this should reach web push subscribers too,
not just the installed app.

No client-side 'already sent today' tracking needed - the backend
endpoint is idempotent, so this safely fires every app load without
needing to worry about duplicate greetings; a module-level guard just
prevents firing more than once per session as the person navigates
between pages.
